Z||000027||MotherGoose||05-17-2001||12:17 PM||||First off this is to Jay.  You sound like my dad, who's to say what substance is.  Is it baseball bat to the head, or shooting a guy in the neck? I don't think so.  You just like violence, some people like to laugh.  Substance is relative, and there is very little substance to movies.  I don't want to start flaming, just seemed like you were talking down alittle.<P>Now my list:<BR>Young Frankinstien<BR>Forrest Gump<BR>Caddyshack<BR>Awakenings<BR>Heavy Metal<BR>Last Supper<BR>Live and Let Die<BR>All Kevin Smith Movies<BR>All Monte Python Movies--"Isn't it awefully nice to have a Penis!  Hoorah for the one-eyed trouser snake!"<P><p>[This message has been edited by MotherGoose (edited 05-17-2001).]||||reg||6
