Z||000056||Ken Wittlief||05-25-2001||09:43 AM||||These arent necessarilly my favorites but nobody has mentioned them yet:<P>Koy an is cot skee (spelled phonitically) I could watch that movie over and over - music is haunting<P>RollerBall - Moonpie - Moonpie - Moonpie!<P>Vanishing Point (i second that one)<P>Wind (the part where they are doing the Geronimo dance on the deck of the sailboat had me cheering out loud!)<P>Jerad Sim: Adventures in the Forbidden Zone (stunk so bad it was hilarious)<P>Rainman (definately a great rewatch, definately - you can buy it at Kmart, 427 W madison street - this is definately not my underwear - Ut Oh, Fart!)<P>When we were teenagers my friends and I use to watch really bad scifi movies, turn the sound off, and make up our own scripts as the movie was playing - it was a blast. Use to laugh so hard we had tears in our eyes.<P>the best indication of a great movie is how many times you can watch it and still enjoy it and laugh and find new stuff in it.<P>Looking forward to:<P>Lord of the Rings - JRR Tolkens book - this December!!!<P>wait I forgot:<P>the Right stuff!! (I did not do anything wrong, the hatch just BLEW!)<P><p>[This message has been edited by Ken Wittlief (edited 05-25-2001).]||||reg||1
